    <tags>cywave cybrium security cli rust cross-platform admin</tags>
    <summary>Wi-Fi, BLE, Zigbee, LoRaWAN and drone detection</summary>
    <description>Wireless RF sensor that detects and inventories Wi-Fi, Bluetooth Low Energy, Zigbee, LoRaWAN and drone signals for wireless attack surface monitoring.

The Windows binary is Authenticode-signed by Cybrium Inc via Azure Trusted Signing. The install script downloads the release binary from GitHub, verifies its SHA-256 checksum, and refuses to install if the Authenticode signature is not valid. Verify after install with:

    Get-AuthenticodeSignature (Get-Command cywave).Source
</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/cybrium-ai/cywave/releases/tag/v0.2.1</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools/**" target="tools" />
